  <jpcrp_cor:StrategyTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(2) 戦略&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;各重要課題に対する戦略は経営計画の基本戦略に反映しており、該当する戦略は以下のとおりです。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:17pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:17pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;「地域経済の発展と産業振興」&lt;/p&gt;
