&lt;h4 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;連結自己資本比率（国内基準）&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;                                   (単位：百万円、％)&lt;/p&gt;
